skip: ## The brief contract — refuse an incomplete brief, ask about a vague one
text: ## Input — a dispatch token, never a brief
text:
text: This prompt is the Sweep mode of `workbench-dev-team:lestrade`. It takes only
text: the machine-built token `Repo sweep: <owner/repo>`, never a six-slot brief.
text: If your prompt carries no such token, it reached the wrong type: change
text: nothing, and report that the dispatch carried no `Repo sweep: <owner/repo>`
text: token.
